      "content": "it's not just \"feelings\" though. it's the actual reality of my life. there is no end in sight. it’s just this endless loop of sickness and cleaning and watching someone fade away while I fade away too. sometimes i think it would be more merciful for everyone if i just wasn't here. it feels like a logical conclusion to all this. like, why keep struggling if the struggle is all there is?",
